ext","value":"Financial data indicates that while economists command substantial median salaries, the field exhibits a significant variance in earnings. This high standard deviation reflects the expanded agency professionals enjoy regarding their compensation structures. Increased productivity provides economists the leverage to prioritize personal fulfillment: such as family time or diverse intellectual interests, over maximum pecuniary gain. This narrative of professional autonomy and strategic trade-offs is clearly evidenced by the observed distribution metrics.","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"lalGbr0Ufp"}],"key":"Kpbvk0Qa89"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"According to 2024 data from the ","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"key":"ww7usJPCbQ"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"US Bureau of Labor Statistics","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"key":"mUsXNB14Hd"}],"key":"zHvihO5S9y"},{"type":"text","value":", economists across various educational backgrounds command significant compensation. The median annual salary for professionals in the field reached ","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"key":"Zv2xmXQYoM"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"115,440**, with earnings spanning from **","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>115</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>440</mn><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi>